{"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"content","content":[{"text":"Overview","anchor":"Overview","level":2,"type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Use this module to track the application’s lifecycle on any platform. Nothing is tracked until","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the app calls ","type":"text"},{"code":"trackLifecycle","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" on its tracker as it launches, and keeps the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/LifecycleTracking\/documentation\/LifecycleTracking\/LifecycleObservation","type":"reference"},{"text":" it returns; tracking stops when that is cancelled, finished or released.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"For the screens and controls inside the app, see","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"https:\/\/tyler-keith-thompson.github.io\/Traffluent\/documentation\/traffluent\/automatictracking","type":"reference"},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"As it starts, it compares the app’s version (","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"CFBundleShortVersionString"},{"text":" by default, or","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"version:"},{"text":") with the one its ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/LifecycleTracking\/documentation\/LifecycleTracking\/VersionStore","type":"reference"},{"text":" saved at the last launch. No saved version tracks","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/LifecycleTracking\/documentation\/LifecycleTracking\/ApplicationInstalled","type":"reference"},{"text":", a different one ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/LifecycleTracking\/documentation\/LifecycleTracking\/ApplicationUpdated","type":"reference"},{"text":", the same one neither. Then it","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"tracks ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/LifecycleTracking\/documentation\/LifecycleTracking\/ApplicationOpened","type":"reference"},{"text":". After that, from ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"UIApplication"},{"text":"’s, ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"WKApplication"},{"text":"’s or","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"NSApplication"},{"text":"’s notifications, it tracks ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/LifecycleTracking\/documentation\/LifecycleTracking\/ApplicationBackgrounded","type":"reference"},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/LifecycleTracking\/documentation\/LifecycleTracking\/ApplicationOpened","type":"reference"},{"text":" from","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the background and, where the platform reports it, ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/LifecycleTracking\/documentation\/LifecycleTracking\/ApplicationTerminated","type":"reference"},{"text":", each once per","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"transition. A server or a tool on Linux has no notifications, so it calls","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/LifecycleTracking\/documentation\/LifecycleTracking\/LifecycleObservation\/finish()","type":"reference"},{"text":" as it ends:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"syntax":"swift","code":["let tracker = Tracker()","let lifecycle = tracker.trackLifecycle(version: \"2.1\", versionStore: InMemoryVersionStore(version: \"2.0\"))","\/\/ tracks ApplicationUpdated(previousVersion: \"2.0\", version: \"2.1\"), then ApplicationOpened(fromBackground: false)","","\/\/ ... the process's work ...","","await lifecycle.finish()  \/\/ tracks ApplicationTerminated","await tracker.finish()"],"type":"codeListing"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The store keeps the version and nothing else. "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/LifecycleTracking\/documentation\/LifecycleTracking\/FileVersionStore","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" keeps it in a file, by default"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"beside a "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"SegmentStore"},{"type":"text","text":"’s records; "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/LifecycleTracking\/documentation\/LifecycleTracking\/InMemoryVersionStore","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" keeps it in memory, for tests; any type"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"of yours can conform. "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"kinds:"},{"type":"text","text":" turns kinds of event off, while the version is still saved."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"As the app leaves the foreground, it waits for the tracker’s worker to write every record tracked"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"so far to the tracker’s store, then calls the store’s "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"synchronize()"},{"type":"text","text":". A delivery batched with"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/LifecycleTracking\/documentation\/LifecycleTracking\/LifecycleBatchStrategy","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" ("},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".lifecycle"},{"type":"text","text":") sends what is pending as it reads the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/LifecycleTracking\/documentation\/LifecycleTracking\/ApplicationBackgrounded","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" record. The notification’s handler only hands the transition on; the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"work runs on a task of its own, and where the system suspends apps in the background it holds"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"background time until the records are durable."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"sections":[],"abstract":[{"text":"Track the app’s installs, updates, opens, moves to the background and terminations, and make the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"tracker’s records durable as the app leaves the foreground.","type":"text"}],"metadata":{"title":"LifecycleTracking","roleHeading":"Framework","role":"collection","externalID":"LifecycleTracking","symbolKind":"module","modules":[{"name":"LifecycleTracking"}]},"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"patch":0,"minor":3},"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/lifecycletracking"]}],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/LifecycleTracking\/documentation\/LifecycleTracking"},"topicSections":[{"anchor":"Tracking-the-lifecycle","title":"Tracking the lifecycle","identifiers":["doc:\/\/LifecycleTracking\/documentation\/LifecycleTracking\/Trackers\/Tracker\/trackLifecycle(kinds:version:versionStore:notificationCenter:file:fileID:function:line:column:)","doc:\/\/LifecycleTracking\/documentation\/LifecycleTracking\/LifecycleObservation"]},{"anchor":"Events","title":"Events","identifiers":["doc:\/\/LifecycleTracking\/documentation\/LifecycleTracking\/ApplicationInstalled","doc:\/\/LifecycleTracking\/documentation\/LifecycleTracking\/ApplicationUpdated","doc:\/\/LifecycleTracking\/documentation\/LifecycleTracking\/ApplicationOpened","doc:\/\/LifecycleTracking\/documentation\/LifecycleTracking\/ApplicationBackgrounded","doc:\/\/LifecycleTracking\/documentation\/LifecycleTracking\/ApplicationTerminated"]},{"anchor":"Keeping-the-version","title":"Keeping the version","identifiers":["doc:\/\/LifecycleTracking\/documentation\/LifecycleTracking\/VersionStore","doc:\/\/LifecycleTracking\/documentation\/LifecycleTracking\/FileVersionStore","doc:\/\/LifecycleTracking\/documentation\/LifecycleTracking\/InMemoryVersionStore"]},{"anchor":"Delivering-as-the-app-leaves","title":"Delivering as the app leaves","identifiers":["doc:\/\/LifecycleTracking\/documentation\/LifecycleTracking\/LifecycleBatchStrategy"]},{"generated":true,"anchor":"Extended-Modules","title":"Extended Modules","identifiers":["doc:\/\/LifecycleTracki